{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"警方審視咪錶故障期間發出告票\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/PARK-POLICE-261103-21.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】警方稱正審視咪錶故障期間就路旁泊車位發出的告票，會按實際情況跟進處理，市民如認為其接獲的告票可能與是次系統故障有關，可提出異議。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:41:50.567214+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":72,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:10:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T13:58:21.534885+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:41.545229+00:00","content_hash":"394d60166b76565c7b5f8257a11cd9c90343963410d940398ed621edeef349a9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:41:50.567214+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}